 ## Release note
 The CI release APK is debug-signed for QA/emulator/device testing only. Production signing is a later gate.
+
+
+## M1 Review & Action Console
+
+M1 adds server-authoritative review actions for current KYC documents and partner service skills. Actions are visible only when the authenticated internal user has `partner.verify`. Document decisions are limited to VERIFIED / REJECTED; service decisions are limited to VERIFIED / REJECTED. Every mutation goes through existing Supabase RPCs and RLS/permission checks.
+
+Partner application approval remains read-only in M1 because the `review_partner_application` `p_decision text` allowed values could not be re-verified from the backend connector during this build. No guessed approval action is shipped.
